"--- words-to-expression · seed 1 · difficulty 1
prompt   Write the expression.
display  story [words-to-expression 5 less-than] "5 less than a number"
answer   expression x-5 (x, expanded)
input    expression
variable x
hint     Read the phrase in the order the subtraction happens.
step 1   Write what is subtracted from what, in order.   [x-5]
miss     reversed-order = 5-x   Subtraction order matters — write it in the order the phrase names it.
miss     used-addition = x+5   This phrase means subtraction, not addition.

